{"id":"659226","name":"盐焗鸡翅","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/659226/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡中翅","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"黄栀子","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡中翅洗净备用。","img":"images/659226/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将鸡翅冷水下锅焯烫后再洗净。","img":"images/659226/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡翅加入盐焗粉和花生油。","img":"images/659226/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"抓拌均匀腌制20分钟左右即可。","img":"images/659226/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"腌制过的鸡翅倒入电饭煲里。","img":"images/659226/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入黄栀子。","img":"images/659226/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/659226/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"电饭煲蒸煮30分钟。","img":"images/659226/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"焖好的鸡翅取出晾凉即可。","img":"images/659226/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659226/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659226/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659226/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}